@startuml Hotel_Booking_Flow
title Book Hotels (UC#6) — HOTEL_SELECTION Phase

actor Traveler
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend" as Backend
participant "Hotel Agent" as HotelAgent
participant "Database" as DB

== HOTEL_SELECTION: Agent Picks Hotels ==

Note right of Backend: Hotel Agent runs with finalized stops\nRule-based + LLM hybrid ranking

Backend -> HotelAgent: run_hotel_selection(itinerary, places, profile)
activate HotelAgent

HotelAgent -> DB: Query hotels matching\naccommodation type, budget, proximity
activate DB
DB --> HotelAgent: Matching hotels
deactivate DB

HotelAgent -> HotelAgent: Rank by rating, amenities,\nproximity to stops, reviews
HotelAgent --> Backend: Top 3-5 hotel suggestions
deactivate HotelAgent

Backend --> App: Hotel options with\nratings, amenities, maps, prices
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Display hotel options
deactivate App

== HOTEL_SELECTION: User Picks ==

Traveler -> App: Select a hotel (by number or name)
activate App

App -> Backend: Confirm hotel selection
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: Store selected_hotel in itinerary
Backend --> App: Hotel confirmed
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: "Would you like to proceed to payment?"
deactivate App

== BOOKING Phase ==

Traveler -> App: "Pay now" or "Do it later"
activate App

App -> Backend: Initiate booking
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Create simulated booking record\n(with generated confirmation number)
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Booking saved
deactivate Backend
deactivate DB

alt Pay now
  Backend --> App: Booking created, proceed to payment
  App --> Traveler: Complete via Stripe in app
else Do it later
  Backend --> App: Booking noted, finalize later
  App --> Traveler: Trip finalized
end

Backend -> Backend: Transition to COMPLETED

== Cancel a Booking (before payment) ==

Traveler -> App: Cancel hotel booking
activate App

App -> Backend: Cancel booking\n{booking_id}
activate Backend

Backend -> DB: Mark booking as cancelled
activate DB
DB --> Backend: Booking cancelled
deactivate DB

Backend --> App: Booking cancelled
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Hotel booking cancelled
deactivate App

@enduml
